        "original_id": "56faba58-c124-5542-a95c-5ceaed61bd0c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Connie Ray, Tim Fywell, Hadley Davis, Meg Cabot, Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, Hayden Panettiere\n- Products: Thank You for Smoking, Stuart Little, ER, George Lopez, Ice Princess\n- Roles: actress, playwright, director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Connie Ray was born on July 10, 1956.\n- Connie Ray is an American film and television actress and playwright.\n- Connie Ray appeared on the television drama ER in 1997.\n- Connie Ray appeared in Stuart Little in 1999.\n- Connie Ray appeared on George Lopez in 2002.\n- Ice Princess is a 2005 American figure-skating film.\n- Ice Princess was directed by Tim Fywell.\n- Ice Princess was written by Hadley Davis from a story by Meg Cabot and Hadley Davis.\n- Ice Princess starred Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, and Hayden Panettiere.\n- Connie Ray appeared in Ice Princess in 2005.\n- Connie Ray appeared in Thank You for Smoking in 2006.",
